# 2. MOST IMPORTANT FEATURE — SCHEME READINESS ENGINE

This is the hero feature of the entire application.

Build this workflow before spending time on secondary features.

The complete flow:

1. Citizen enters a request using text or voice.
2. AI understands the citizen's language and intent.
3. AI collects missing profile information.
4. AI searches relevant government schemes and scholarships.
5. AI retrieves scheme details and official government sources.
6. Eligibility engine evaluates the citizen against published eligibility rules.
7. AI explains why the citizen qualifies, does not qualify or needs additional verification.
8. System generates a personalized document checklist.
9. Citizen uploads required documents with consent.
10. AI extracts relevant document information where supported.
11. System prefills the application form.
12. Validation checks missing fields and inconsistent information.
13. Citizen reviews the completed application.
14. System asks for explicit human approval.
15. Citizen can open the verified official application website or use an authorized submission integration if one genuinely exists.
16. System tracks application progress where supported.
17. Agent creates reminders and follow-up tasks.

The complete workflow must be demonstrable from beginning to end.

